  "name": "CS452-LAB5",
  "description": "A low-level computer graphics implementation in Rust focused on the OpenGL programmable pipeline and texture mapping. The project demonstrates the manual configuration of Vertex Array Objects (VAO) and Vertex Buffer Objects (VBO) to render textured primitives using custom GLSL shaders. It employs early-stage Rust idioms and external C-bindings for windowing and OpenGL context orchestration.",
